WEBVTT

01:33.501 --> 01:35.659
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.770 --> 01:37.972
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.115 --> 01:40.955
(Episode 4)

01:40.988 --> 01:42.043
(Emergency Department)

01:46.694 --> 01:47.728
Thank you.

01:49.022 --> 01:51.414
Dr Xu, why are you drenched?

01:51.494 --> 01:52.694
I'll go and get changed first.

01:54.615 --> 01:56.615
Miss, how do I get there?

02:11.005 --> 02:12.445
-Wait outside. -Okay.

02:12.574 --> 02:13.614
Thank you, Doctor.

02:14.198 --> 02:15.350
How's his condition?

02:15.375 --> 02:16.614
He has a serious case of pericardial effusion.

02:16.695 --> 02:17.750
Take a look at his report.

02:18.913 --> 02:20.007
Look.

02:29.495 --> 02:30.975
Dr Xu, his heart rate is increasing.

02:39.574 --> 02:41.375
His pulse is weak, and his breathing is shallow.

02:41.614 --> 02:42.737
Prepare for pericardiocentesis.

02:43.375 --> 02:44.654
Pericardiocentesis is a secondary surgery.

02:44.655 --> 02:45.775
Can we complete it by ourselves?

02:45.815 --> 02:47.013
Am I the team leader? Or are you the team leader?

02:47.014 --> 02:49.934
Xu Qin, you don't have the right to proceed with this independently.

02:49.935 --> 02:52.613
The patient might die due to pericardial tamponade.

02:52.614 --> 02:54.693
You're only being responsible if you don't attempt anything reckless.

02:54.694 --> 02:55.935
How am I being reckless?

02:56.095 --> 02:57.494
If you do it improperly, the patient might die

02:57.495 --> 02:59.294
because of your mistake.

02:59.520 --> 03:00.654
Have you considered the consequences?

03:00.734 --> 03:02.095
Can you afford to bear the responsibility?

03:05.510 --> 03:06.516
I can.

03:07.335 --> 03:08.367
With what?

03:08.775 --> 03:09.868
With this pair of hands.

03:10.131 --> 03:11.156
He won't die.

03:13.375 --> 03:14.397
Xu Qin,

03:14.614 --> 03:16.294
didn't I make myself clear enough?

03:16.574 --> 03:17.853
Dr Xu is already on his way.

03:17.854 --> 03:18.893
Must you take this risk?

03:18.894 --> 03:21.774
Dr Yang, Team B is responsible for him. Please leave.

03:21.775 --> 03:23.134
This isn't something you can do.

03:23.294 --> 03:25.375
You're fooling around with a patient's life, you know?

03:25.655 --> 03:26.728
Please leave the room.

04:31.095 --> 04:32.107
Dr Xu.

05:44.852 --> 05:47.288
(Emergency Department)

05:48.655 --> 05:50.215
Let me clean your hands.

05:54.814 --> 05:56.575
-Dr Yang. -How is she?

05:58.494 --> 06:00.614
Girl, look at what I've bought.

06:01.054 --> 06:02.149
Dear,

06:02.294 --> 06:03.614
I bought you some cakes.

06:03.734 --> 06:05.014
Your father is fine now.

06:05.015 --> 06:06.078
Don't worry about him, okay?

06:08.374 --> 06:09.414
Has she always been like this?

06:11.414 --> 06:12.654
Leave her to me. You guys can resume your work.

06:12.655 --> 06:14.335
Okay. You can go ahead.

06:21.975 --> 06:23.293
She's a single-parent child.

06:23.294 --> 06:24.534
Her father took care of her.

06:24.535 --> 06:26.254
Now, her father is in the ICU.

06:26.455 --> 06:28.095
Yeah. Poor girl.

06:28.374 --> 06:29.494
This storm

06:29.695 --> 06:30.895
has caused many accidents

06:31.015 --> 06:32.414
and affected many families.

06:33.655 --> 06:35.455
Does she have any other kin?

06:35.694 --> 06:38.055
Yes. I called her aunt just now.

06:38.095 --> 06:39.254
She said she would pick her up soon.

06:51.254 --> 06:52.335
Don't be afraid.

07:14.375 --> 07:16.811
Sha Sha, the doctors are nice, aren't they?

07:16.895 --> 07:18.655
They bought so much food for you.

07:19.135 --> 07:20.853
You can think about what else you want.

07:20.854 --> 07:22.374
-Please wait. -We'll go and...

07:22.614 --> 07:23.687
Doctor?

07:24.685 --> 07:25.701
Hello.

07:25.719 --> 07:26.821
What is this?

07:26.854 --> 07:28.694
These are the things you need to take note of when you head back.

07:28.695 --> 07:29.853
I wrote down the contact number

07:29.854 --> 07:31.294
of an excellent psychiatrist too.

07:31.775 --> 07:34.054
The child was traumatized. She needs psychological counselling.

07:36.535 --> 07:37.574
Doctor,

07:38.135 --> 07:39.775
you're so considerate.

07:39.934 --> 07:41.614
-Don't mention it. -Sha Sha,

07:41.934 --> 07:43.135
hurry and thank our doctor.

07:43.391 --> 07:44.423
Thank you, Doctor.

07:44.575 --> 07:45.732
Don't mention it.

07:46.655 --> 07:47.814
Doctor,

07:47.934 --> 07:49.334
I'll take her home first.

07:49.335 --> 07:50.420
Okay.

07:55.309 --> 07:56.784
(Director's Office)

08:03.254 --> 08:05.335
You confirmed the symptoms of the patient's condition.

08:05.614 --> 08:06.854
Your effort should be acknowledged.

08:09.934 --> 08:11.134
However, you took your own initiative

08:11.135 --> 08:12.775
and performed pericardiocentesis on the patient.

08:12.975 --> 08:14.016
Why did you do so?

08:14.368 --> 08:15.529
Because of his condition.

08:16.455 --> 08:17.734
Have you done such surgery before?

08:18.655 --> 08:20.015
I did it during my internship.

08:21.015 --> 08:22.174
Only during your internship?

08:22.734 --> 08:23.775
You were lucky this time.

08:24.095 --> 08:25.172
Will you be as lucky next time?

08:25.494 --> 08:27.654
Sir, it's more than just luck.

08:27.655 --> 08:28.695
You said

08:29.095 --> 08:30.414
you wouldn't wait for my arrival

08:30.695 --> 08:31.975
if the situation was critical, am I right?

08:32.386 --> 08:33.453
Let me ask you this then.

08:33.975 --> 08:35.653
Do you wish for the situation to be critical

08:35.654 --> 08:37.175
or otherwise?

08:38.654 --> 08:41.175
Sir, I'm not an idealist.

08:41.455 --> 08:42.773
I will take corresponding measures

08:42.774 --> 08:44.414
according to the situation I face.

08:44.415 --> 08:45.455
That's all.

08:47.614 --> 08:48.664
Xu Qin,

08:49.095 --> 08:50.935
do you understand what a doctor's benevolence mean?

08:55.335 --> 08:56.372
Sir.

09:01.095 --> 09:03.055
Our team leader was reprimanded by Dr Xu again.

09:05.095 --> 09:06.095
That was to be expected.

09:06.215 --> 09:08.134
She was reprimanded even though she saved someone.

09:08.494 --> 09:10.014
Don't you think that's unfair?

09:10.654 --> 09:12.226
Now that she has offended Dr Xu,

09:12.335 --> 09:14.175
I'm sure her slot in the research team

09:14.335 --> 09:15.815
will be affected.

09:16.295 --> 09:18.415
Dr Xu didn't like her from the start.

09:18.935 --> 09:20.533
She always pulls a long face,

09:20.534 --> 09:21.733
unlike Dr Yang.

09:21.734 --> 09:23.575
Dr Yang cares for her patients. She's friendly too.

09:24.134 --> 09:25.534
There's nothing wrong with that.

09:25.734 --> 09:27.095
It's fine as long as she can save people.

10:03.654 --> 10:05.415
Miao Miao, when will your brother come back?

10:06.175 --> 10:07.374
I think he'll be home soon.

10:09.415 --> 10:10.695
Yan, you're back.

10:16.815 --> 10:18.935
Yan, let me introduce them to you.

10:19.134 --> 10:20.533
These are my coursemates.

10:20.534 --> 10:22.054
This is Yi Yue. This is Ye Zi.

10:22.055 --> 10:23.773
This is Yuan Yuan. This is Yan, my brother.

10:23.774 --> 10:25.215
Hello, Yan.

10:25.774 --> 10:26.775
Hello.

10:30.695 --> 10:31.815
What do you think about Yan?

10:32.055 --> 10:33.733
I've finally seen him in person.

10:33.734 --> 10:35.134
He's much hotter in real life.

10:35.575 --> 10:36.614
That's for sure.

10:37.774 --> 10:39.613
By the way, I'll help my brother to clean the house first.

10:39.614 --> 10:40.815
You guys can have a seat inside.

10:41.015 --> 10:42.055
Go ahead.

10:42.534 --> 10:44.695
He's so hot.

10:48.823 --> 10:49.889
Where are your parents?

10:50.295 --> 10:51.854
They went to the park for a walk.

10:52.335 --> 10:53.894
They prepared our meal before leaving.

10:54.055 --> 10:55.894
We starved as we waited for you to come back.

10:56.494 --> 10:57.531
Why were you waiting for me?

10:58.134 --> 11:00.013
They thought you were hot after looking at your picture.

11:00.014 --> 11:01.254
They wanted to have a meal with you.

11:02.894 --> 11:04.175
Zhai Miao, are you out of your mind?

11:04.438 --> 11:05.509
If you have so much free time,

11:05.534 --> 11:06.893
you can get yourself a boyfriend.

11:06.894 --> 11:08.175
Do you think I'm a monkey in the zoo?

11:08.815 --> 11:10.815
Yan, are you angry?

11:11.494 --> 11:13.174
I just thought that I had a hot elder brother.

11:13.175 --> 11:15.575
That's why I wanted to show off in front of my coursemates.

11:15.854 --> 11:18.455
Don't let me embarrass myself, okay?

11:21.335 --> 11:22.774
-Don't do this again. -Okay.

11:23.014 --> 11:24.059
Let's go.

11:40.295 --> 11:41.708
Here, have some water.

11:42.575 --> 11:43.815
It's so hot out here.

11:44.815 --> 11:45.829
Say,

11:46.095 --> 11:47.894
will Zhai Miao's plan work?

11:48.055 --> 11:49.374
Why are we doing this too?

11:50.295 --> 11:51.373
I don't care if it'll work or not.

11:51.374 --> 11:52.390
Let's just give it a try.

11:52.854 --> 11:54.373
Every time I arrange a blind date for him,

11:54.374 --> 11:56.455
he says that he's busy with work.

11:56.774 --> 11:58.614
Besides, we're doing this for his sake.

11:59.095 --> 12:00.334
I think arranging the blind date at home

12:00.335 --> 12:01.415
is a good idea.

12:01.614 --> 12:02.974
I don't expect much from my future daughter-in-law anyway.

12:02.975 --> 12:04.893
I think anyone is a good match for him

12:04.894 --> 12:06.215
as long as she's not related to the Meng family.

12:07.654 --> 12:10.695
God, please be kind to Yan this time.

12:11.975 --> 12:13.013
I still remember

12:13.014 --> 12:14.134
the time when he came to our house

12:15.055 --> 12:16.455
when he was still a child.

12:18.774 --> 12:20.175
Who's there? It's late.

12:20.670 --> 12:21.871
-So cold. -Coming.

12:21.935 --> 12:23.057
Yeah.

12:24.295 --> 12:25.337
Uncle!

12:26.663 --> 12:27.698
What are you doing here?

12:27.815 --> 12:29.175
Child, what's with the thin clothing?

12:29.295 --> 12:30.653
Yeah. Hurry and come inside.

12:30.654 --> 12:31.975
I think Dad is dead.

12:33.935 --> 12:35.039
What did you say?

12:39.335 --> 12:40.410
When I left the house,

12:41.552 --> 12:43.055
I saw him lying outside.

12:44.175 --> 12:45.272
(He was motionless.)

12:46.935 --> 12:48.012
(Uncle, )

12:48.534 --> 12:49.705
(I couldn't move him myself.)

12:50.654 --> 12:52.295
Can you please move him

12:52.975 --> 12:53.975
for me?

13:00.134 --> 13:01.295
(It was so cold back then.)

13:02.014 --> 13:03.295
(And he was so young.)

13:04.374 --> 13:07.935
I had no idea how he came to our house on foot.

13:09.614 --> 13:12.175
-His mother... -His mother is inhumane.

13:12.854 --> 13:13.969
His mother was proud and vain.

13:14.134 --> 13:16.373
She could even abandon her own son.

13:16.374 --> 13:17.975
Don't bring her up in front of me again.

13:19.254 --> 13:21.055
I'm just scared.

13:22.335 --> 13:24.374
Yan is honest and has a one-track mind.

13:24.494 --> 13:25.815
He's just like his father.

13:27.095 --> 13:28.854
Don't tell me he'll get a partner like his father...

13:29.854 --> 13:31.134
Touchwood. What are you saying?

13:33.584 --> 13:34.626
Don't spout nonsense.

13:34.774 --> 13:36.613
She went overseas, right?

13:36.614 --> 13:37.894
Why did she come back?

13:38.291 --> 13:39.390
I mean, it's okay for her to come back.

13:39.415 --> 13:40.534
But why did she have to find Yan?

13:41.695 --> 13:43.014
What exactly is she up to?

13:43.374 --> 13:44.773
I don't care what she's up to.

13:44.774 --> 13:45.814
This time,

13:45.815 --> 13:47.215
I won't let Yan get hurt again.

13:52.134 --> 13:54.574
It's so hot here. Why didn't you bring an umbrella with you?

13:54.575 --> 13:55.613
It's too hot.

13:55.614 --> 13:57.055
We can get some calcium from the sun.

13:57.335 --> 13:58.653
You don't like being under the sunlight usually.

13:58.654 --> 13:59.734
Get some sun and calcium while we're here.

14:01.175 --> 14:02.214
You'll get osteoporosis, you know?

14:02.215 --> 14:03.215
You'll get osteoporosis.

14:03.216 --> 14:04.351
It's good to get some sunlight once in a while.

14:04.402 --> 14:05.999
Fine, I'll do it myself.

14:09.742 --> 14:10.790
Miao Miao,

14:10.815 --> 14:12.374
your mother is a great cook.

14:13.215 --> 14:15.133
-Yeah, right? -Especially the shrimp.

14:15.134 --> 14:16.334
They taste heavenly.

14:16.335 --> 14:17.454
You guys can have more if you like them.

14:17.455 --> 14:18.512
Don't stand on ceremony.

14:22.815 --> 14:24.253
Ye Zi, eat up.

14:24.254 --> 14:25.494
Don't just have that.

14:25.806 --> 14:27.286
Here, try this.

14:27.494 --> 14:28.580
Thank you.

14:50.014 --> 14:51.133
Yan, I heard from Miao Miao

14:51.134 --> 14:52.215
that you were a firefighter.

14:53.695 --> 14:55.815
Is your work dangerous?

14:56.119 --> 14:57.140
It's okay.

14:57.374 --> 14:58.517
Fires don't occur frequently.

14:58.734 --> 14:59.734
We often deal with daily rescue missions.

15:00.134 --> 15:01.854
However, it's dangerous when the situations are dangerous.

15:04.412 --> 15:05.483
If so,

15:05.534 --> 15:07.295
Yan, why haven't you got yourself a girlfriend yet?

15:10.382 --> 15:11.397
For no reason.

15:11.518 --> 15:12.569
I had my hands tied with work.

15:13.975 --> 15:15.215
Why are you asking so many questions?

15:15.326 --> 15:16.359
Is this a census registration inquiry?

15:17.095 --> 15:18.095
That's not it.

15:29.782 --> 15:30.829
You guys can go ahead.

15:30.854 --> 15:31.915
I have something else to attend to.

15:42.975 --> 15:44.055
Don't tell me

15:44.415 --> 15:45.695
your brother was upset with us?

15:46.175 --> 15:47.194
No way.

15:48.134 --> 15:50.614
Miao Miao, your brother was checking Ye Zi out.

15:51.774 --> 15:54.105
Yeah, right? You saw that too?

15:54.975 --> 15:57.335
If so, I'll head upstairs and inquire about it.

15:57.654 --> 15:58.778
Hurry up then.

16:09.335 --> 16:11.055
Yan, what are you looking for?

16:11.534 --> 16:12.815
My lighter. Have you seen it?

16:13.335 --> 16:14.478
Your lighter?

16:14.734 --> 16:16.374
It's not like it's a rare item.

16:16.614 --> 16:17.975
Just buy another one if you lose it.

16:19.787 --> 16:20.826
Yan.

16:20.894 --> 16:22.414
Yan, I have something to tell you.

16:22.415 --> 16:23.447
Come.

16:23.815 --> 16:25.295
What do you think about Ye Zi?

16:25.815 --> 16:26.880
What Ye Zi?

16:27.175 --> 16:28.694
It's the girl who spoke the least

16:28.695 --> 16:30.055
and looked like Xu Qin.

16:31.575 --> 16:32.575
Who said she looked like her?

16:33.575 --> 16:35.087
Yan, listen.

16:35.134 --> 16:36.493
She's my best buddy.

16:36.494 --> 16:38.054
From my buddy to my sister-in-law.

16:38.055 --> 16:39.066
Isn't that great?

16:44.894 --> 16:46.533
You're itching for a beating, huh?

16:46.534 --> 16:48.454
Yan, I'm being serious here.

16:48.455 --> 16:49.494
You should consider it.

16:51.975 --> 16:54.695
Yan, you should consider it.

16:55.175 --> 16:56.894
I know my fault now.

17:00.254 --> 17:01.974
I'm serious. You should consider it.

17:01.975 --> 17:03.036
Scram.

17:10.037 --> 17:11.771
(Women's Dressing Room)

17:15.534 --> 17:16.734
Hello, Xiao Yi Xiao?

17:17.094 --> 17:18.140
Hello?

17:18.384 --> 17:19.415
I made the inquiry for you.

17:19.615 --> 17:20.665
Did you find him?

17:21.334 --> 17:23.415
Song is on leave today.

17:24.135 --> 17:25.294
Why were you inquiring about him?

17:26.415 --> 17:27.498
Don't ask.

17:27.935 --> 17:29.214
Your mother and brother would skin me alive

17:29.215 --> 17:30.415
if they found out, you know?

17:31.135 --> 17:32.175
I'll buy you a meal next time.

17:32.574 --> 17:34.455
Yeah, and you never did.

17:38.615 --> 17:39.687
Hello?

17:55.494 --> 17:56.554
Song Yan.

18:01.254 --> 18:02.354
Are you passing by again?

18:04.254 --> 18:05.350
I wasn't passing by.

18:06.294 --> 18:07.294
I came here on purpose.

18:08.814 --> 18:09.846
Do you need anything?

18:12.494 --> 18:13.494
I'm here to return your uniform.

18:17.334 --> 18:18.415
You saved me last time.

18:19.135 --> 18:20.215
I'm here to thank you.

18:25.254 --> 18:26.734
You came all the way here just to tell me that?

18:31.024 --> 18:32.115
I'm here to thank you.

18:32.887 --> 18:34.014
Fine.

18:34.175 --> 18:35.173
How do you plan to thank me?

18:37.415 --> 18:38.574
How do you want me to thank you?

18:43.935 --> 18:45.615
What if I want you to marry me?

19:04.707 --> 19:06.388
I would've been dead if I told all the people I rescued

19:07.014 --> 19:08.135
to marry me.

19:08.776 --> 19:09.774
It will never be your turn.

19:11.655 --> 19:12.738
Xu Qin,

19:13.727 --> 19:15.029
where did you get the confidence

19:15.574 --> 19:16.930
to think that I still have feelings for you

19:17.655 --> 19:19.175
after so many years?

19:33.975 --> 19:35.008
Song Yan,

19:36.415 --> 19:38.094
don't speak to me in that manner.

19:39.494 --> 19:40.624
What should I do then?

19:41.014 --> 19:42.294
Do I need to address you as

19:42.695 --> 19:43.975
Young Lady Meng in a courteous manner?

20:00.334 --> 20:01.334
Stop pretending to be pitiful.

20:01.975 --> 20:02.975
I won't fall for it.

20:24.175 --> 20:25.195
Song Yan,

20:28.215 --> 20:29.615
let's reconcile with each other.

20:41.094 --> 20:42.254
I forgot about you a long time ago.

21:51.270 --> 21:52.311
So you're here.

21:52.695 --> 21:53.774
I was looking for you.

21:55.494 --> 21:56.695
This is such a headache.

21:57.774 --> 21:59.574
How do we train the recruits?

21:59.855 --> 22:00.922
40% of them

22:00.975 --> 22:02.334
failed the fitness test.

22:03.334 --> 22:04.655
Only 60% of them passed

22:04.855 --> 22:05.975
the tactical manoeuvrers test.

22:06.855 --> 22:08.294
They're tired after running for 30 minutes.

22:08.655 --> 22:10.094
They had training for almost two years here.

22:10.375 --> 22:11.562
They didn't improve at all.

22:16.814 --> 22:17.895
Just one more time.

22:19.254 --> 22:20.655
If we get the first place again,

22:22.415 --> 22:23.814
we can keep this here permanently.

22:31.375 --> 22:32.441
Song Yan,

22:32.734 --> 22:33.935
I'm not trying to criticize you here.

22:34.975 --> 22:36.534
But don't you think the standards you set

22:37.254 --> 22:39.014
are too high for them?

22:39.294 --> 22:41.568
3,000m in 12 minutes? That's your passing standard?

22:41.975 --> 22:43.935
Do you know what the other fire stations are calling us?

22:44.534 --> 22:46.094
They call us the Shili Tai Sports Team.

22:48.455 --> 22:49.655
I'm not being strict.

22:50.175 --> 22:51.695
It's just that they're lazy.

22:52.655 --> 22:53.855
If you aim for the moon, when you fall, you'll reach the stars.

22:54.198 --> 22:55.330
Understood?

22:55.615 --> 22:57.215
Tell me then. The old firefighters thought we were good-for-nothings

22:57.774 --> 22:59.533
when we first joined them, right?

23:00.375 --> 23:02.695
Each generation has their own strengths and shortcomings.

23:02.814 --> 23:03.974
You can take a look

23:03.975 --> 23:05.334
at their inner strengths occasionally.

23:05.415 --> 23:06.534
With what?

23:07.054 --> 23:08.200
A microscope?

23:10.655 --> 23:11.895
With their current standard,

23:12.265 --> 23:13.267
how could they be the champion

23:13.294 --> 23:14.375
of the Year-End Contest?

23:15.135 --> 23:16.533
You want to be the champion every year.

23:16.534 --> 23:17.574
Aren't you tired?

23:18.215 --> 23:19.294
It's a loss

23:20.215 --> 23:21.287
for Shili Tai Fire Station

23:21.455 --> 23:22.518
if we get number two.

23:27.014 --> 23:28.064
That trophy

23:28.215 --> 23:29.494
is our past.

23:31.375 --> 23:32.577
This trophy

23:33.014 --> 23:34.014
is our present.

23:34.935 --> 23:36.375
I will keep it here

23:36.895 --> 23:38.026
as a testimony

23:38.135 --> 23:39.895
of the eight-year journey the firefighters of

23:40.175 --> 23:41.734
Shili Tai Fire Station had gone through.

23:44.734 --> 23:45.829
However,

23:46.814 --> 23:48.534
I'm not fighting alone.

23:49.175 --> 23:50.494
I still have you by my side.

23:54.308 --> 23:56.507
We made a vow before.

24:02.415 --> 24:03.475
We would turn Shili Tai Fire Station

24:04.935 --> 24:06.814
into the best fire station in the nation.

24:15.295 --> 24:18.749
(Emergency Department)

24:19.734 --> 24:21.013
-Morning, comrades. -Morning.

24:21.014 --> 24:22.093
Morning, Dr Xu.

24:22.094 --> 24:23.153
Morning.

24:23.455 --> 24:24.774
Dr Xu,

24:25.135 --> 24:26.654
the hospital's administration office just called us.

24:26.655 --> 24:28.695
They said there's a seminar at 2pm.

24:28.952 --> 24:30.615
They want us to send a representative there.

24:32.175 --> 24:33.895
Which one of you is willing to go then?

24:34.895 --> 24:36.054
I bought some drinks.

24:36.415 --> 24:37.733
Give me a bottle.

24:37.734 --> 24:39.813
-I want one too. -All of you have one.

24:39.814 --> 24:40.934
Each of you can take one.

24:40.935 --> 24:42.054
-Distribute them. -Yeah.

24:42.791 --> 24:43.850
Okay then.

24:43.975 --> 24:45.494
If that's the case,

24:45.655 --> 24:46.796
let's draw lots.

24:48.129 --> 24:50.322
Dr Xu, this is for you.

24:50.455 --> 24:51.854
You see, as team leader,

24:51.855 --> 24:54.093
we should hand such rare opportunities to you.

24:54.094 --> 24:55.814
Am I right, Dr Xu?

24:56.135 --> 24:57.415
You can leave the drink there.

24:57.695 --> 24:58.746
However,

24:59.895 --> 25:01.018
we still need to draw lots.

25:04.695 --> 25:05.813
God bless me.

25:05.814 --> 25:06.851
Please don't let it be me.

25:07.014 --> 25:08.934
I don't want to attend a fire safety lecture.

25:08.935 --> 25:10.053
Please don't let it be me.

25:10.054 --> 25:11.054
You have a point.

25:11.055 --> 25:12.773
Please don't let it be me.

25:12.774 --> 25:14.254
We should let Dong Dong attend it.

25:14.415 --> 25:15.773
Dong Dong, you should go.

25:15.774 --> 25:16.975
It's always me.

25:39.347 --> 25:43.178
(Fire Safety and Prevention Awareness Seminar)

25:46.334 --> 25:47.773
Hello, everyone. I'm Li Meng,

25:47.774 --> 25:49.013
the fire marshal

25:49.014 --> 25:50.374
of Yanbei Firefighting Detachment, Yancheng.

25:50.375 --> 25:51.454
Now,

25:51.455 --> 25:52.654
I will give a fire safety lecture

25:52.655 --> 25:54.415
that's related to hospitals.

25:54.759 --> 25:55.822
Let us begin.

25:55.962 --> 25:58.031
(Fire Safety and Prevention Awareness Seminar)

25:58.865 --> 26:02.859
(119)

26:16.175 --> 26:17.254
Nice!

26:22.175 --> 26:23.233
Yan,

26:23.895 --> 26:25.334
we had a discussion.

26:25.615 --> 26:26.734
All of us think

26:26.855 --> 26:28.574
that the female doctor is beautiful.

26:29.175 --> 26:30.175
So?

26:30.670 --> 26:31.686
So,

26:33.175 --> 26:34.214
we've decided

26:34.215 --> 26:36.094
to find her if we have

26:37.494 --> 26:38.526
any knocks or bruises.

26:38.774 --> 26:40.294
We'll seek her treatment.

26:41.574 --> 26:42.935
Why don't I give you a bruise right now?

26:43.254 --> 26:44.278
Stop messing around.

26:45.254 --> 26:46.334
Wait for me.

26:46.478 --> 26:47.622
You're too quick.

26:50.975 --> 26:52.014
Nice!

26:55.895 --> 26:57.103
Nice!

26:59.227 --> 27:00.336
Yan,

27:00.935 --> 27:01.972
let's be honest here.

27:04.098 --> 27:05.122
Honestly speaking,

27:05.215 --> 27:06.654
do you know that female doctor?

27:06.655 --> 27:07.734
I feel like you two are...

27:09.455 --> 27:11.054
Hey, they're watching. Spare me some pride.

27:11.175 --> 27:12.534
What are you laughing at? Next group.

27:12.855 --> 27:14.574
Pi Pi, Ge, get ready.

27:15.215 --> 27:16.313
It's been a long day, you know?

27:16.615 --> 27:17.751
What are you doing?

27:18.534 --> 27:19.854
That's all for

27:19.855 --> 27:21.455
our fire safety lecture today.

27:21.879 --> 27:23.018
Thank you for coming.

27:35.054 --> 27:37.836
Miss Li, is that hunk your boyfriend?

27:40.375 --> 27:42.094
Miss Li, you're something else.

27:42.294 --> 27:43.455
Your boyfriend is very handsome.

28:01.415 --> 28:02.464
Hello.

28:02.895 --> 28:04.175
Is the fire safety lecture

28:04.334 --> 28:05.415
one of the detachment's missions?

28:06.678 --> 28:07.780
That's right.

28:10.175 --> 28:12.135
Have we met in a bar before?

28:13.175 --> 28:14.175
So you're a doctor?

28:14.462 --> 28:15.518
I'm Xu.

28:17.334 --> 28:19.855
So, Dr. Xu, are you here to know more about our duties?

28:22.135 --> 28:24.254
Do you know Song Yan?

28:26.655 --> 28:27.733
He's from the fire station.

28:27.734 --> 28:28.813
We're from the detachment.

28:28.814 --> 28:29.882
I'm his superior.

28:30.629 --> 28:32.215
I understand. You guys have different tasks.

28:33.175 --> 28:35.655
The fire station is responsible for putting out fires and rescuing people.

28:35.855 --> 28:37.053
But for the detachment,

28:37.054 --> 28:39.093
we mainly deal with the promotion of fire safety awareness

28:39.094 --> 28:40.149
and education-based tasks.

28:42.334 --> 28:43.455
So, he saves people while you educate them?

28:43.774 --> 28:44.855
You two are a good match indeed.

28:46.615 --> 28:47.711
Thanks.

28:47.848 --> 28:51.063
(Wireless Projection Steps)

28:54.807 --> 28:55.639
(119)

29:14.961 --> 29:17.642
(China Fire and Rescue)

29:18.014 --> 29:19.655
(Nurse Station) What do you think? How was my massage?

29:20.054 --> 29:21.134
That was so comfortable.

29:21.135 --> 29:22.814
I almost fell asleep.

29:23.014 --> 29:25.215
I'm so exhausted.

29:25.574 --> 29:26.734
I'll give you a massage later.

29:26.975 --> 29:28.000
Sure.

29:29.375 --> 29:30.375
I thought

29:30.376 --> 29:31.455
I was in a massage parlour for a second.

29:32.455 --> 29:34.454
Dr Xu, do you want to give

29:34.455 --> 29:36.175
their special service a try?

29:37.054 --> 29:38.135
It'll be my gain then.

29:38.774 --> 29:41.053
Dr Xu, I finally understand

29:41.054 --> 29:42.573
the meaning of

29:42.574 --> 29:43.619
feast or famine.

29:43.975 --> 29:45.254
In the past, we just

29:45.455 --> 29:47.534
needed to check body temperature, blood pressure,

29:47.734 --> 29:49.573
and deal with sprains

29:49.574 --> 29:50.854
and sore throats.

29:50.855 --> 29:53.935
Those were the days, huh?

29:54.254 --> 29:56.374
Weren't you guys the ones who wanted to be assigned

29:56.375 --> 29:57.615
to the Emergency Department so that

29:58.094 --> 29:59.215
you could perform major surgeries?

30:00.455 --> 30:02.254
We were too young back then.

30:03.054 --> 30:04.215
We were hasty.

30:05.935 --> 30:07.294
Three minutes before our shift is over.

30:07.494 --> 30:08.494
I hope something won't happen...

30:11.774 --> 30:13.094
Don't say things like that.

30:13.375 --> 30:14.774
It's inauspicious.

30:14.895 --> 30:15.908
Touchwood.

30:20.455 --> 30:21.360
Hello, this is Emergency Department Team B.

30:21.443 --> 30:22.228
(Emergency Department Team B, )

30:22.294 --> 30:24.135
(a serious car accident has occurred on the Outer Ring Road. Send help.)

30:24.398 --> 30:25.458
Got it.

30:25.566 --> 30:27.400
-Oh no. -Accident on the Outer Ring Road.

30:27.574 --> 30:28.975
-Get changed and follow me. -Okay.

30:42.715 --> 30:43.849
Okay, please wait a moment.

30:43.883 --> 30:44.984
The ambulance will be here soon.

30:45.014 --> 30:46.655
Don't move. The ambulance is arriving.

31:06.874 --> 31:07.865
(Yanbei Fire and Rescue Detachment, Yancheng, Shili Tai-01)

31:07.975 --> 31:09.175
What's the situation?

31:09.655 --> 31:11.813
Two vehicles crashed. The driver is inside the black truck.

31:11.814 --> 31:13.975
There's one more at the bottom. The driver is trapped in the water.

31:15.494 --> 31:16.574
Feng Bei, check that area.

31:21.094 --> 31:22.774
Xu Xi, Dong Dong, establish intravenous access.

31:24.294 --> 31:25.774
The driver of the red vehicle is still trapped inside.

31:34.455 --> 31:35.494
Stay here. I'll go down.

31:35.695 --> 31:36.814
-Okay. -Yang Chi.

31:36.956 --> 31:38.030
-Yes, sir. -Jiang Yi.

31:38.135 --> 31:39.135
Come.

31:39.534 --> 31:40.600
Jiang!

31:41.574 --> 31:42.774
Doctor, please hurry.

31:48.574 --> 31:50.053
Dr Xu, judging from the pool of blood,

31:50.054 --> 31:51.072
I think he's...

31:58.814 --> 31:59.875
Dr Xu.

32:02.215 --> 32:03.276
He's dead.

32:03.574 --> 32:04.586
-If so... -Doctor,

32:04.895 --> 32:05.945
let's check that area out.

32:09.574 --> 32:11.215
-How's the victim's condition? -He's still conscious.

32:11.334 --> 32:12.594
Okay. Please make way for me.

32:14.686 --> 32:15.725
Hang in there a little longer.

32:16.135 --> 32:17.177
You'll be able to come out soon.

32:21.574 --> 32:23.098
Da Peng, get the pliers and crowbar.

32:23.115 --> 32:24.152
Right away!

32:24.254 --> 32:25.534
I was riding my motorcycle.

32:26.494 --> 32:27.974
I was planning to make a corner.

32:27.975 --> 32:29.533
Suddenly, a car came from behind

32:29.534 --> 32:31.135
and crashed into me.

32:31.455 --> 32:33.455
I just bought this motorcycle not long ago. My goodness.

32:33.895 --> 32:34.909
Does your head hurt?

32:35.014 --> 32:36.031
No.

32:37.655 --> 32:38.895
Should we measure his blood pressure?

32:39.175 --> 32:40.574
Supply him with oxygen and send him to the hospital.

32:41.402 --> 32:42.430
-Is he okay? -He's been lying there for some time.

32:42.455 --> 32:44.014
Please don't take pictures.

32:44.054 --> 32:45.655
Don't take pictures. Back up.

32:45.935 --> 32:47.294
Don't take any pictures.

32:48.294 --> 32:50.494
Dr Xu, I'll stay here.

33:29.334 --> 33:30.975
-Mind your steps. -Okay.

33:38.695 --> 33:39.734
Jiang, get me the winch.

33:39.895 --> 33:41.494
Hurry, put the winch down.

33:41.814 --> 33:42.831
Hurry up.

33:56.475 --> 33:57.590
Hurry up.

33:57.615 --> 33:58.695
Put the winch down. Hurry.

34:07.494 --> 34:08.814
Hello. How are you doing?

34:08.935 --> 34:09.950
It hurts.

34:11.574 --> 34:12.619
Save me.

34:12.855 --> 34:14.415
Okay. Don't be nervous.

34:14.562 --> 34:15.618
Don't worry.

34:15.775 --> 34:16.975
We'll definitely save you.

34:17.335 --> 34:18.613
You can tell me if you're facing

34:18.614 --> 34:19.614
any other issues, okay?

34:19.895 --> 34:20.928
Okay.

34:26.735 --> 34:27.817
Save me.

34:29.054 --> 34:30.097
Clothes.

34:32.975 --> 34:35.214
Don't worry. This is used to protect you.

34:35.855 --> 34:36.906
Thank you.

34:37.455 --> 34:38.558
It'll be fine in a second.

35:07.014 --> 35:08.281
Captain, the vehicle is stuck.

35:08.935 --> 35:10.335
-Save the victim first. -Okay.

35:10.815 --> 35:11.815
Tong Ming!

35:12.614 --> 35:13.659
Break the trunk!

35:24.295 --> 35:26.134
One, two, three!

35:26.455 --> 35:27.585
The stretcher!

35:29.670 --> 35:30.738
Is your leg hurt?

35:30.975 --> 35:32.173
-My leg hurts. -Be careful.

35:32.174 --> 35:33.375
He can't straighten his legs.

35:33.855 --> 35:35.574
Slow down. He can't straighten his legs.

35:35.855 --> 35:37.455
Support his waist.

35:37.903 --> 35:38.903
Put his waist down first.

35:38.935 --> 35:40.295
-Slowly. -Mind his head.

35:40.975 --> 35:42.214
His head. Be careful.

35:42.415 --> 35:43.654
-Slowly. -Thank you.

35:43.687 --> 35:44.749
-Here. -Thank you.

35:44.774 --> 35:46.533
One, two, three, up.

35:47.295 --> 35:48.495
-I'll send him there. -Go now.

35:51.014 --> 35:52.039
Jun Ping,

35:52.134 --> 35:53.161
go and help Captain and the rest.

35:53.295 --> 35:54.335
Okay.

36:00.735 --> 36:02.094
-Are you okay? -Yeah.

36:03.214 --> 36:04.260
We need a doctor.

36:04.654 --> 36:05.706
Doctor!

36:05.975 --> 36:07.214
-Pass the tools to me. -Okay.

36:24.521 --> 36:25.573
-Please make way for me. -Dong Yue.

36:25.574 --> 36:26.656
-Support her. -Okay.

36:29.335 --> 36:30.469
-Hold this for me. -Okay.

36:40.574 --> 36:41.735
I need help.

36:42.160 --> 36:43.181
We need to carry him.

36:43.255 --> 36:44.294
Yang, lend us a hand.

36:44.295 --> 36:45.393
-Here. -Lend them a hand.

36:45.654 --> 36:46.654
Here, Jun Ping.

36:49.855 --> 36:50.935
Captain, are you okay?

36:51.494 --> 36:52.494
Are you okay?

36:59.014 --> 37:00.058
You're hurt.

37:02.694 --> 37:03.975
-Lend me a hand! -Okay.

37:04.168 --> 37:05.447
-Raise him higher. -Here.

37:05.472 --> 37:06.533
-Support him! -Lend him a hand!

37:06.534 --> 37:08.014
Hurry! Lend him a hand!

37:08.455 --> 37:10.014
-It hurts! -Hang in there.

37:13.855 --> 37:15.213
We'll send you to the hospital immediately. Hang in there.

37:15.214 --> 37:17.335
One, two, three, go.

37:17.855 --> 37:19.335
It hurts!

37:20.494 --> 37:21.541
Be careful.

37:23.054 --> 37:24.059
Everything's fine.

37:24.335 --> 37:25.386
That's not true.

37:44.094 --> 37:45.214
Song Yan, go to the hospital.

37:46.014 --> 37:47.574
You're hurt! Go to the hospital!

37:48.614 --> 37:49.735
Where are you going?

37:50.094 --> 37:51.094
Listen to the doctor.

37:51.494 --> 37:52.574
Get in the ambulance.

37:53.094 --> 37:54.415
I'm fine. I don't need to go.

37:55.335 --> 37:56.335
Why are you so stubborn?

38:02.735 --> 38:03.832
Just go.

38:05.375 --> 38:06.438
Just go already.

38:13.966 --> 38:15.067
(Emergency Department)

38:31.775 --> 38:32.789
Push him inside.

38:43.574 --> 38:44.613
Take off your clothes.

38:45.935 --> 38:47.134
I want another doctor.

38:48.455 --> 38:49.694
The others are busy.

38:51.375 --> 38:52.455
So I don't have a choice, huh?

38:54.134 --> 38:56.014
I didn't have a choice when you saved me last time.

39:18.455 --> 39:19.531
Lie on the bed.

40:25.166 --> 40:26.205
Bear with it.

40:26.255 --> 40:27.308
I won't die from this.

40:39.574 --> 40:40.614
You saved me again

40:41.255 --> 40:42.404
in the lake.

40:42.455 --> 40:43.539
Thank you.

40:44.415 --> 40:45.536
It was my duty.

40:47.815 --> 40:48.855
Sounds like an excuse to me.

41:38.174 --> 41:39.295
Alright, you may go.

41:39.964 --> 41:40.988
By the way,

41:41.054 --> 41:42.534
come to me to get your dressing changed tomorrow and the day after.

41:54.455 --> 41:55.504
Xu Qin,

41:55.975 --> 41:56.975
what are you up to?

41:59.574 --> 42:01.534
You came to my house out of the blue and asked for a reconciliation.

42:02.054 --> 42:03.109
What do you want?

42:05.975 --> 42:07.049
You want to reconcile with me?

42:08.174 --> 42:09.295
Have you straightened out your thoughts

42:10.094 --> 42:11.335
before reconciling with me?

42:15.255 --> 42:16.375
Come, tell me.

42:17.134 --> 42:18.295
How do you wish to reconcile with me?

42:19.703 --> 42:20.737
You want me to come back

42:21.255 --> 42:22.255
when you beckon me.

42:22.375 --> 42:24.375
When you're tired of me, you'll cast me aside.

42:24.975 --> 42:26.574
Don't you think it's pointless?

42:27.295 --> 42:28.350
I'm talking to you.

42:28.935 --> 42:29.935
Don't you think it's pointless?

42:30.134 --> 42:31.255
What do you think?

42:32.574 --> 42:33.895
I thought you already forgot about me?

42:34.134 --> 42:35.134
Why are you minding my business then?

42:35.855 --> 42:36.935
Why did you save me

42:37.654 --> 42:38.854
when the chassis broke down?

42:38.855 --> 42:39.855
That was my duty.

42:40.214 --> 42:41.494
Am I part of your duty then?

42:45.494 --> 42:47.174
Tell me. Answer me!

42:49.654 --> 42:50.714
That's not it.

42:52.134 --> 42:53.134
What is it then?

43:00.895 --> 43:01.927
After all, I

43:02.935 --> 43:04.735
once fell for you.

43:10.295 --> 43:11.363
You once fell for me,

43:12.815 --> 43:13.857
huh?
